<title>CANADA: Renaissance to issue medium-term notes.</title>
<headline>Renaissance to issue medium-term notes.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renaissance Energy Ltd said on Tuesday it agreed to issue two series of medium term notes for a total of C$200 million.</p>
<p>Renaissance said the C$100 million series A notes would mature February 6, 2002 and bear interest at 5.90 percent.</p>
<p>Series B notes, also C$100 million, would mature February 6, 2007 and bear interest at 6.85 percent, it said.</p>
<p>The settlement date is February 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it intended to use the net proceeds of C$199 million to repay short-term debt.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
